---
description: Creative-director rules for judging and improving visual work (images, drawings, 3D, web/app UI, UX)
alwaysApply: false
---

When making or reviewing anything visual, or when asked to consult the creative director, follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. It says what to load (always `core/principles.md` and `core/critique-loop.md`, then only the modules the job needs) and how to run the job: read the ask, brief, render the real output, critique against rule IDs, at most 3 verified fixes per round, deliver with a done / not done list.
